  "items": [
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "PostgreSQL 19 用 RDTSC 降低计时开销",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 19 换掉了 EXPLAIN ANALYZE 的取时方式。pganalyze 的 Lukas Fittl 解释，旧的 RDTSCP 指令会阻塞并发执行，5000 万行的 COUNT(*) 开计时要 4200 毫秒、不开只要 1900 毫秒。19 改用不阻塞的 RDTSC，平均计时开销从 5–10% 降到 2–3%，并新增 timing_clock_source，x86-64 上默认走 TSC。",
      "url": "https://pganalyze.com/blog/5mins-postgres-19-reduced-timing-overhead-explain-analyze",
      "author": "Lukas Fittl",
      "source": "pganalyze 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-11",
      "image": "https://pganalyze.com/blog/5mins-postgres-19-reduced-timing-overhead-explain-analyze/pganalyze_OG_5-mins-of-Postgres-E122.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "PostgreSQL 19",
        "EXPLAIN",
        "性能"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "autovacuum 成本延迟归零会引发写入风暴",
      "summary": "Jeremy Schneider 复盘了把 autovacuum_vacuum_cost_delay 设成 0 的后果。归零等于关掉成本控制，autovacuum 全速运行，靠提示位刷出大量脏页，WAL 量随之暴涨。现场表现是 COMMIT 上 IPC:SyncRep 等待激增，一张只做 INSERT 的 40GB 表里出现连片 FPI_FOR_HINT。改回默认的 2 毫秒后波动收敛，复制延迟和应用延迟都回落。",
      "url": "https://ardentperf.com/2026/04/12/zero-autovacuum_cost_delay-write-storms-and-you/",
      "author": "Jeremy Schneider",
      "source": "ardentperf",
      "source_date": "2026-04-12",
      "image": "https://ardentperf.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/image.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "autovacuum",
        "WAL",
        "调优"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "从 pg_stat_activity 读懂 LWLock 等待事件",
      "summary": "Richard Yen 讲解怎么用 pg_stat_activity 的 wait_event_type 与 wait_event 两列读懂后端卡在哪里，重点是保护共享缓冲区、WAL 缓冲区、锁表和 SLRU 的 LWLock。文中逐个说明 buffer_content、WALWriteLock、WALInsertLock、ProcArrayLock 的竞争场景。方法是先按等待事件分组统计，再结合并发写入和事务速率判断负载热点。",
      "url": "https://richyen.com/postgres/2026/04/13/wait_events.html",
      "author": "Richard Yen",
      "source": "richyen.com",
      "source_date": "2026-04-13",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "等待事件",
        "LWLock",
        "诊断"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "column_encrypt v4.0 简化列级加密模型",
      "summary": "Vibhor Kumar 发布 column_encrypt v4.0，这个扩展用 encrypted_text 与 encrypted_bytea 两种类型做列级透明加密。新版把管理函数收进 encrypt schema，三角色权限模型简化为单一的 column_encrypt_user，日志脱敏改为自动完成；函数更名为 register_key、load_key、rotate 与 verify。升级需先经 v3.3 过渡。",
      "url": "https://vibhorkumar.wordpress.com/2026/04/12/column_encrypt-v4-0-a-simpler-safer-model-for-column-level-encryption-in-postgresql/",
      "author": "Vibhor Kumar",
      "source": "Vibhor Kumar 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-04-12",
